typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 238px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/31/The_staircase_under_which_is_located_nuclear_warhead.png/revision/latest?cb=20240712115219\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The staircase under which is located nuclear warhead\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/31/The_staircase_under_which_is_located_nuclear_warhead.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/238?cb=20240712115219\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"238\" height=\"107\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"The staircase under which is located nuclear warhead.png\" data-image-key=\"The_staircase_under_which_is_located_nuclear_warhead.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:The_staircase_under_which_is_located_nuclear_warhead.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>Despite its appearance, it has a normal-sized explosion. This explosion, however, will fling any nearby objects absurdly far.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the second most expensive item in the game with the price of <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$10,000,000</span>, the most expensive being the Glass Ducky Case and the third being the <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903032616\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 81/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory